WEBVTT

00:01.362 --> 00:02.534
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:02.603 --> 00:04.500
all: Aye aye, captain!
全体：是啊，队长！

00:04.568 --> 00:05.844
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:05.913 --> 00:07.810
all: Aye aye, captain!
全体：是啊，队长！

00:07.879 --> 00:10.637
- Oh...
[water bubbles]
- 哦...
[水泡]

00:10.706 --> 00:12.948
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.017 --> 00:14.948
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:15.017 --> 00:17.017
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.086 --> 00:18.844
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:18.913 --> 00:20.637
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:20.706 --> 00:22.431
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:22.500 --> 00:25.017
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.086 --> 00:26.948
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:27.017 --> 00:28.879
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:28.948 --> 00:30.879
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:30.948 --> 00:32.879
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:32.948 --> 00:34.465
- ♪ SpongeBob ♪
- ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:34.534 --> 00:36.327
♪ SquarePants! ♪
♪ 方裤！ ♪

00:36.396 --> 00:37.706
[laughing]
[笑]

00:37.775 --> 00:41.293
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:41.362 --> 00:42.775
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:45.568 --> 00:48.500
[slack-key guitar music]
[松键吉他音乐]

00:48.568 --> 00:55.568
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:55.637 --> 00:56.672
- Mm, mm.
- 嗯，嗯。

00:56.741 --> 00:58.017
[raspberry blows]
Oh.
[覆盆子吹]
哦。

00:58.086 --> 00:59.775
- [whimpers]
- [blowing raspberries]
- [呜咽]
- [吹覆盆子]

00:59.844 --> 01:01.293
all: [gasp]
全体：[喘气]

01:01.362 --> 01:05.051
- Mustard, mustard, step right
up for your mustard.
- 芥末，芥末，向右走
准备你的芥末。

01:05.120 --> 01:07.189
Some mustard for you.
[bottle blows raspberries]
给你一些芥末。
[瓶子吹覆盆子]

01:07.258 --> 01:09.879
Eh, eh, eh.
呃，呃，呃。

01:09.948 --> 01:11.396
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

01:11.465 --> 01:14.086
- Cool!
- 凉爽的！

01:14.155 --> 01:16.431
- A bit of the yellow for you.
- 给你一点黄色。

01:16.500 --> 01:18.637
Doy.
多伊。

01:18.706 --> 01:20.741
[ship whistles and glops]
[船的汽笛声和咕噜声]

01:20.810 --> 01:22.120
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

01:22.189 --> 01:25.672
- [indistinct whispering]
- Oh, okay.
- [含糊不清的窃窃私语]
- 哦，好吧。

01:25.741 --> 01:27.086
Eh.
呃。

01:27.155 --> 01:28.810
[accordion music]
[手风琴音乐]

01:28.879 --> 01:30.913
And a Mr. Mustard for you.
还有芥末先生送给你。

01:30.982 --> 01:33.810
- [purrs]
Mmm, yummy.
- [呼噜声]
嗯，好吃。

01:33.879 --> 01:35.155
- Hyah!
- 哈！

01:35.224 --> 01:36.706
- [coughs]
[droplet plinks]
- [咳嗽]
[水滴叮当响]

01:36.775 --> 01:38.396
all: Aw.
全体：噢。

01:38.465 --> 01:42.396
- Hang on, folks, I'll be right
back with more mustard.
- 等一下，伙计们，我马上就来
回来加更多芥末。

01:42.465 --> 01:43.465
[engine turns over]
[发动机转动]

01:43.534 --> 01:45.844
Whoo!
[tires squeal]
呼！
[轮胎吱吱声]

01:45.913 --> 01:47.189
Let's see.
让我们来看看。

01:47.258 --> 01:48.327
Ketchup.
番茄酱。

01:48.396 --> 01:49.500
Mayonnaise.
蛋黄酱。

01:49.568 --> 01:51.982
Oh, mustard.
哦，芥末。

01:52.051 --> 01:54.879
- Did you use up
all me mustard?
- 你用完了吗
我都是芥末吗？

01:54.948 --> 01:57.396
- [stammering]
What?
- [结巴]
什么？

01:57.465 --> 02:00.396
- Oh, who gives
a flying fish about mustard?
- 哦，谁给的
一条关于芥末的飞鱼？

02:00.465 --> 02:02.017
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

02:02.086 --> 02:05.396
But Squidward, without mustard
I wouldn't be able to make a--
但是章鱼哥，没有芥末
我无法做出——

02:05.465 --> 02:06.672
- Krabby Patty.
- 克拉比帕蒂。

02:06.741 --> 02:09.465
That's right, you're both
hereby ordered
没错，你们俩都是
特此命令

02:09.534 --> 02:12.155
to go down into
the mustard mines.
深入到
芥末矿。

02:12.224 --> 02:15.293
And bring me back more mustard.
给我带回来更多的芥末。

02:15.362 --> 02:16.844
- Mustard mines?
- 芥末地雷？

02:16.913 --> 02:19.603
- Mmm, mustard.
- 嗯，芥末。

02:19.672 --> 02:21.224
Uh...
呃...

02:21.293 --> 02:23.396
Ah.
啊。

02:23.465 --> 02:24.637
[burps]
[打嗝]

02:24.706 --> 02:26.189
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:26.258 --> 02:29.293
And you are going down
to the mustard mines too.
而你正在下降
也到芥末矿。

02:29.362 --> 02:32.431
- I wouldn't do that
if I was you.
- 我不会那样做
如果我是你。

02:32.500 --> 02:33.948
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

02:34.017 --> 02:36.327
[spits]
[sizzling]
[吐口水]
[嘶嘶声]

02:36.396 --> 02:39.948
That old mustard mine
is cursed.
那个老芥末矿
被诅咒了。

02:40.017 --> 02:42.637
- Cursed?
- What kind of curse?
- 被诅咒了？
- 什么样的诅咒？

02:42.706 --> 02:45.637
- It's, uh, er, one of those--
- 这是，呃，呃，其中之一--

02:45.706 --> 02:48.017
The Mummy's Curse.
木乃伊的诅咒。

02:48.086 --> 02:50.982
- [snickers] There's no
such thing as mummies.
- [窃笑]没有
诸如木乃伊之类的东西。

02:51.051 --> 02:53.017
- We've all got mummies.
- 我们都有木乃伊。

02:53.086 --> 02:55.500
Eh?
[giggles]
呃？
[咯咯笑]

02:55.568 --> 02:56.982
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

02:57.051 --> 02:59.431
I've been in that mine.
我一直在那个矿井里。

02:59.500 --> 03:03.396
No one that enters
gets out alive.
没有人进入
活着出去。

03:03.465 --> 03:05.844
- [shrieking]
[spooky music]
- [尖叫]
[诡异的音乐]

03:05.913 --> 03:09.258
[thunder roars]
[雷霆怒吼]

03:09.327 --> 03:10.775
- You got out and you're alive.
- 你出去了，你还活着。

03:10.844 --> 03:13.396
- Ah, but am I?
- 啊，但是我是吗？

03:13.465 --> 03:15.706
- Yeah, you're standing
right there.
- 是的，你站着
就在那里。

03:15.775 --> 03:17.948
- But am I?
- 但我是吗？

03:18.017 --> 03:19.810
- Yeah, you're right--
- 是的，你说得对--

03:19.879 --> 03:21.500
Hmm.
唔。

03:21.568 --> 03:23.086
- I see your foot.
- 我看到你的脚了。

03:23.155 --> 03:24.603
- No, you don't.
- 不，你不知道。

03:24.672 --> 03:27.603
- Ah, his foot's gone!
- 啊，他的脚没了！

03:27.672 --> 03:28.982
[seagull caws]
[海鸥的叫声]

03:29.051 --> 03:30.431
- This map doesn't show us
- 这张地图没有向我们展示

03:30.500 --> 03:32.603
where the mustard vein
is located.
芥末脉在哪里
位于。

03:32.672 --> 03:34.189
Well, let's just start picking.
好吧，让我们开始挑选吧。

03:34.258 --> 03:35.672
- Way ahead of you, pal.
- 远远领先于你，朋友。

03:35.741 --> 03:38.500
- Ugh.
- 呃。

03:38.568 --> 03:40.741
- [nose pops]
- [鼻子爆裂]

03:40.810 --> 03:42.982
Ooh.
哦。

03:43.051 --> 03:44.293
[brain smearing]
[脑涂片]

03:44.362 --> 03:46.879
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

03:46.948 --> 03:49.224
both: [gasp]
Oh.
两人：[喘气]
哦。

03:49.293 --> 03:51.017
♪ A-mining we will go ♪
♪ 我们要去 A 采矿 ♪

03:51.086 --> 03:52.603
♪ The mustard, it will flow ♪
♪ 芥末，它会流动 ♪

03:52.672 --> 03:54.396
♪ With pick and axe
Without the facts ♪
♪ 用镐和斧头
没有事实依据♪

03:54.465 --> 03:56.396
♪ There's nothing
that we know ♪
♪ 什么都没有
我们都知道♪

03:56.465 --> 03:58.672
Ta-da.
[mine rumbles]
哒哒。
[地雷的隆隆声]

04:01.017 --> 04:02.500
- Huh?
- 啊？

04:02.568 --> 04:03.603
You nitwits.
你们这些白痴。

04:03.672 --> 04:05.120
How will we get out now?
现在我们怎么出去？

04:05.189 --> 04:07.637
- Ah, we're trapped in a mine.
- 啊，我们被困在矿井里了。

04:07.706 --> 04:09.810
We'll never get out.
我们永远出不去。

04:09.879 --> 04:13.086
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:13.155 --> 04:16.706
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

04:16.775 --> 04:18.465
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:18.534 --> 04:20.500
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

04:22.810 --> 04:24.327
- Krabby Patty, stat.
- 克拉比·帕蒂，统计数据。

04:24.396 --> 04:26.844
- Mm.
- 毫米。

04:26.913 --> 04:29.741
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

04:29.810 --> 04:31.879
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

04:31.948 --> 04:34.120
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

04:34.189 --> 04:37.120
Oh.
[gulps]
哦。
[吞咽]

04:37.189 --> 04:39.431
- He's coming 'round.
- Squidward.
- 他回来了。
- 章鱼哥。

04:39.500 --> 04:42.258
I--I need--
- What can I get for you?
我——我需要——
- 我能为你买点什么？

04:42.327 --> 04:45.327
- I need a little mustard
for the Krabby Patty.
- 我需要一点芥末
蟹肉饼。

04:45.396 --> 04:48.120
- Why do I even bother?
- 为什么我还要麻烦呢？

04:48.189 --> 04:49.775
Maybe there's a back door.
也许有后门。

04:49.844 --> 04:51.603
both: Hey, wait for us.
两人：嘿，等我们一下。

04:51.672 --> 04:54.431
- Whoa.
- 哇哦。

04:54.500 --> 04:56.431
- I wonder how deep it is.
- 我想知道它有多深。

04:56.500 --> 04:59.500
- I'll check.
- 我会检查一下。

04:59.568 --> 05:01.568
Wahhh!
哇哦！

05:05.327 --> 05:07.913
Don't bother jumping.
That shaft has no bottom.
别费心跳了。
那个轴没有底部。

05:07.982 --> 05:10.327
Let's take the escalator.
我们乘自动扶梯吧。

05:10.396 --> 05:14.051
- All right, spread out.
- 好吧，散开。

05:14.120 --> 05:16.844
[calm elevator music]
[平静的电梯音乐]

05:16.913 --> 05:19.810
- Coal miners.
- 煤矿工人。

05:19.879 --> 05:21.051
Ew.
呃。

05:21.120 --> 05:22.706
- Sulfur miners.
- 硫磺矿工。

05:22.775 --> 05:24.258
- Phew.
- 唷。

05:24.327 --> 05:27.568
Unaccompanied minors.
[drum sting]
无人陪伴的未成年人。
[鼓刺]

05:27.637 --> 05:31.189
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:31.258 --> 05:35.155
- All right, let's get to work,
chowderheads.
- 好吧，我们开始工作吧
海鲜杂烩浓汤。

05:35.224 --> 05:36.258
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

05:36.327 --> 05:37.948
Hey, I found something yellow.
嘿，我发现了一些黄色的东西。

05:38.017 --> 05:40.189
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:40.258 --> 05:42.672
Never mind, it's just gold.
没关系，这只是金子。

05:42.741 --> 05:46.086
- All I'm getting
is dumb old diamonds.
- 我所得到的一切
是愚蠢的老钻石。

05:47.603 --> 05:49.362
- This must be
the Mummy's Curse
- 这一定是
木乃伊的诅咒

05:49.431 --> 05:52.189
that old guy
was talking about.
那个老家伙
正在谈论。

05:52.258 --> 05:54.879
- Gold and diamonds?
- 黄金和钻石？

05:54.948 --> 05:56.258
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:56.327 --> 05:58.086
Gold dust.
金粉。

05:58.155 --> 06:00.672
No, no, it's just sand.
不不不，这只是沙子。

06:00.741 --> 06:04.637
- [blowing raspberries]
Whoa!
- [吹覆盆子]
哇！

06:04.706 --> 06:07.603
[screaming]
[尖叫]

06:07.672 --> 06:09.051
- Ah.
- 啊。

06:09.120 --> 06:11.362
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

06:16.155 --> 06:18.086
- Uh, what was that?
- 呃，那是什么？

06:18.155 --> 06:20.568
- Ah, the greatest
treasure of all,
- 啊，最伟大的
一切的宝藏，

06:20.637 --> 06:22.637
a child.
一个孩子。

06:24.741 --> 06:26.879
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

06:26.948 --> 06:28.844
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

06:28.913 --> 06:30.741
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:30.810 --> 06:32.672
[telephone rings]
[电话铃声]

06:32.741 --> 06:33.810
Hello?
你好？

06:33.879 --> 06:35.741
- SpongeBob,
where's me mustard?
- 海绵宝宝，
我芥末在哪里？

06:35.810 --> 06:37.603
[angry chatter]
- I want some mus--
[愤怒的喋喋不休]
-我想要一些音乐--

06:37.672 --> 06:41.568
- On the way, sir,
as soon as we find it.
- 先生，在路上，
一旦我们找到它。

06:41.637 --> 06:43.155
Love you.
爱你。

06:43.224 --> 06:47.568
- Oh, we'll never find
that mustard vein.
-哦，我们永远找不到
那芥末静脉。

06:47.637 --> 06:48.913
Oh.
哦。

06:48.982 --> 06:52.258
What is this?
这是什么？

06:52.327 --> 06:55.431
- Local train
approaching station.
- 当地火车
接近车站。

06:55.500 --> 06:57.982
[train rumbles]
[火车隆隆声]

06:58.051 --> 07:00.293
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

07:00.362 --> 07:02.637
[slack-key guitar music]
[松键吉他音乐]

07:02.706 --> 07:04.672
- Hurry up, Squidward,
before the doors close.
- 快点，章鱼哥
在门关闭之前。

07:04.741 --> 07:06.534
- It's the last train
of the night.
- 这是末班车
当晚的。

07:06.603 --> 07:08.155
- Do you have a metro card?
- 你有地铁卡吗？

07:08.224 --> 07:10.810
- [frantically grunting]
- [疯狂地咕哝]

07:10.879 --> 07:12.500
Ah, I got it.
啊，我明白了。

07:12.568 --> 07:14.913
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:14.982 --> 07:16.913
- Come on, Squidward!
- 来吧，章鱼哥！

07:16.982 --> 07:18.431
- Watch the closing doors.
- 注意关闭的门。

07:18.500 --> 07:20.706
- [grunting]
[card reader beeps]
- [咕哝]
[读卡器发出蜂鸣声]

07:20.775 --> 07:24.844
- Faster, Squidward, faster!
- [groaning]
- 快点，章鱼哥，快点！
- [呻吟]

07:24.913 --> 07:26.534
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:26.603 --> 07:31.258
- Hey, Squidward, you really
should watch the closing doors.
- 嘿，章鱼哥，你真的
应该留意关闭的门。

07:31.327 --> 07:33.017
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

07:33.086 --> 07:34.982
- This is a local mining train
- 这是当地的采矿列车

07:35.051 --> 07:38.327
making all stops between
Coal and Limestone.
之间的所有停留
煤和石灰石。

07:38.396 --> 07:40.086
Next stop, Condiments.
下一站，调味品。

07:40.155 --> 07:42.293
- Oh, that's our stop.
- 哦，那是我们的站。

07:42.362 --> 07:44.913
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:44.982 --> 07:47.913
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

07:47.982 --> 07:49.879
[thumps]
[重击]

07:49.948 --> 07:52.362
- Come on, Squidward.
- 来吧，章鱼哥。

07:52.431 --> 07:53.741
- [head bangs]
- [刘海]

07:53.810 --> 07:56.086
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:56.155 --> 08:02.948
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:03.017 --> 08:05.465
Hmm.
唔。

08:05.534 --> 08:07.810
Ah, la, hmm.
Ah.
啊，啦，嗯。
啊。

08:07.879 --> 08:09.706
I've struck mayo.
我已经打了蛋黄酱。

08:09.775 --> 08:11.775
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:13.465 --> 08:16.120
Hot sauce.
辣酱。

08:16.189 --> 08:19.500
- Ah.
- 啊。

08:19.568 --> 08:22.500
I struck blood.
我撞到了血。

08:22.568 --> 08:24.741
Oh, no, it's ketchup.
哦，不，这是番茄酱。

08:24.810 --> 08:26.051
[slurps]
[啜饮]

08:26.120 --> 08:28.327
- We're getting close.
- 我们已经很接近了。

08:28.396 --> 08:30.672
[harp music]
[竖琴音乐]

08:30.741 --> 08:33.465
Oh.
哦。

08:33.534 --> 08:35.913
Mustard. Ahhh!
芥末。啊啊！

08:35.982 --> 08:37.086
I struck mustard!
我打了芥末！

08:37.155 --> 08:38.568
- Mustard?
- Mustard?
- 芥末？
- 芥末？

08:38.637 --> 08:40.672
all: ♪ Look at all
the mustard flow ♪
全部：♪ 看看全部
芥末流♪

08:40.741 --> 08:42.844
♪ Look at all
the mustard flow ♪
♪ 看看所有
芥末流♪

08:42.913 --> 08:46.189
♪ That golden yellow
fatty acid treat ♪
♪ 那金黄色
脂肪酸治疗♪

08:46.258 --> 08:47.741
[whirring]
[呼呼]

08:47.810 --> 08:49.189
[thump]
[扑通]

08:49.258 --> 08:50.810
- [spits]
- [吐口水]

08:50.879 --> 08:54.362
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:54.431 --> 08:57.775
Oh, no,
what are we gonna do now?
哦，不，
我们现在要做什么？

08:57.844 --> 09:00.155
- I think we better
use our heads.
- 我认为我们更好
用我们的头脑。

09:00.224 --> 09:02.224
- Let's use my head.
- 让我们用我的头脑吧。

09:02.293 --> 09:04.534
[grunting, whirring]
[咕噜声，呼呼声]

09:04.603 --> 09:08.120
[slack-key guitar music]
[松键吉他音乐]

09:08.189 --> 09:10.879
- Argh.
- 啊。

09:10.948 --> 09:13.879
Argh.
啊。

09:13.948 --> 09:15.362
all: The Mummy!
全体：妈咪！

09:15.431 --> 09:19.568
- Stop!
- 停止！

09:19.637 --> 09:22.879
[groaning]
[cork pops out]
[呻吟]
[软木塞弹出]

09:22.948 --> 09:25.327
- [gasps]
It's the Mummy's Curse guy.
- [喘气]
这是木乃伊诅咒的家伙。

09:25.396 --> 09:27.431
- There ain't no curse.
- 没有诅咒。

09:27.500 --> 09:29.672
I just tried to discourage you
chuckleheads
我只是想劝阻你
傻瓜

09:29.741 --> 09:31.465
from mining
this mustard.
来自采矿
这个芥末。

09:31.534 --> 09:32.775
- Oh, I get it,
- 哦，我明白了，

09:32.844 --> 09:35.155
'cause the mummy
wants the mustard.
因为木乃伊
想要芥末。

09:35.224 --> 09:38.189
Mystery solved.
all: Hurrah!
谜团解开了。
全体：万岁！

09:38.258 --> 09:40.086
- 'Tain't no Mummy.
- “没有妈妈。”

09:40.155 --> 09:41.706
This mustard
is sitting on top of
这个芥末
坐在上面

09:41.775 --> 09:44.017
20 million pounds
of pressure.
2000万英镑
的压力。

09:44.086 --> 09:47.810
If you open her up,
she's gonna blow sky high.
如果你打开她的心扉
她会飞得很高。

09:47.879 --> 09:49.913
- Oh, no curse.
- 哦，没有诅咒。

09:49.982 --> 09:51.189
No mummy.
没有妈咪。

09:51.258 --> 09:53.879
And no mustard.
而且没有芥末。

09:53.948 --> 09:56.258
And I'll have
to find another job.
我会有
寻找另一份工作。

09:56.327 --> 09:58.051
[weeps]
[哭泣]

09:58.120 --> 10:00.224
[nose blows]
[擤鼻子]

10:00.293 --> 10:02.534
- Stop.
Don't you see?
- 停止。
你没看到吗？

10:02.603 --> 10:05.155
This old coot wants all
the mustard for himself.
这个老傻瓜想要一切
芥末给自己。

10:05.224 --> 10:07.086
Now uncork that mustard.
现在打开芥末。

10:07.155 --> 10:08.741
- Hmm?
[growls]
- 唔？
[咆哮]

10:08.810 --> 10:11.224
- Oh, put your fists down,
old man.
- 哦，放下你的拳头，
老头儿。

10:11.293 --> 10:13.017
I'm not gonna hurt you.
我不会伤害你。

10:13.086 --> 10:14.844
- Hyah!
- 哈！

10:14.913 --> 10:17.017
- You were right, Squidward,
you're not gonna hurt him.
- 你是对的，章鱼哥，
你不会伤害他的。

10:17.086 --> 10:18.637
- Why you...
- 为什么你...

10:18.706 --> 10:19.603
Ow.
噢。

10:19.672 --> 10:21.224
[grunts]
I'm gonna--
[咕哝]
我要--

10:21.293 --> 10:23.879
[groaning]
[呻吟]

10:23.948 --> 10:27.224
- Go Squidward, you're winning.
You're not hurting him at all.
- 去章鱼哥吧，你赢了。
你根本没有伤害他。

10:27.293 --> 10:29.258
- Let me try not hurting him.
- 让我尽量不伤害他。

10:29.327 --> 10:31.224
- [speaking gibberish]
- [胡言乱语]

10:31.293 --> 10:32.706
- Come on, old-timer.
- 来吧，老家伙。

10:32.775 --> 10:34.948
You know you want
a piece of me.
你知道你想要
我的一部分。

10:35.017 --> 10:36.741
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

10:36.810 --> 10:37.982
- Oh.
- 哦。

10:38.051 --> 10:39.948
- Ow, that hurt.
- 噢，好痛。

10:40.017 --> 10:41.327
- I hurt him.
- 我伤害了他。

10:41.396 --> 10:42.948
That means I lose.
这意味着我输了。

10:43.017 --> 10:44.879
[mine rumbles]
[地雷的隆隆声]

10:44.948 --> 10:47.396
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

10:47.465 --> 10:50.568
- No, no, no, no, no, no, no.
- 不，不，不，不，不，不，不。

10:50.637 --> 10:53.086
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

10:53.155 --> 10:54.913
Whoa...
哇...

10:54.982 --> 10:56.948
- Adiós, muchachos.
- 再见，再见。

10:57.017 --> 10:59.051
[laughing]
[笑]

11:01.844 --> 11:04.362
[calm elevator music]
[平静的电梯音乐]

11:04.431 --> 11:07.051
- [whimpering]
Hmm.
- [呜咽]
嗯。

11:07.120 --> 11:08.327
[telephone rings]
[电话铃声]

11:08.396 --> 11:09.982
I'll get it.
Hello.
我会得到它。
你好。

11:10.051 --> 11:13.017
- Where's me mustard?
- 我在哪里芥末？

11:13.086 --> 11:14.362
- Um...
- 嗯...

11:14.431 --> 11:16.568
- No.
Ow.
- 不。
噢。

11:16.637 --> 11:19.327
[angry chatter]
[愤怒的喋喋不休]

11:19.396 --> 11:20.637
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:20.706 --> 11:23.431
- Your mustard
is coming right up.
- 你的芥末
马上就要来了。

11:23.500 --> 11:26.017
- When?
- Now?
- 什么时候？
- 现在？

11:26.086 --> 11:28.534
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:28.603 --> 11:31.224
- Wow!
Yee-ha!
- 哇！
呀哈！

11:31.293 --> 11:32.637
Yeah.
是的。

11:32.706 --> 11:34.982
[delighted chatter]
[高兴的喋喋不休]

11:35.051 --> 11:37.982
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

11:38.051 --> 11:40.431
- What, no relish?
- 什么，没胃口？

- 什么，没胃口？